I don't have a perl script but I just wrote a bash one for you.
grep killed /usr/games/lib/nethackdir/logfile | awk -F killed '{print"killed"$NF}' | sort | uniq | sort

Creates an output like: 
killed by Mr. Akalapi, the shopkeeper
killed by Mr. Ossipewsk, the shopkeeper
killed by Ms. Enniscorthy, the shopkeeper
killed by Ms. Yildizeli, the shopkeeper
